{"id":137926844206700,"type":"artist","name":"Paul Anka","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":125,"info":{"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Paul_Anka_1995.jpg?width=500","bio":"Paul Anka es un cantante, compositor y actor canadiense nacido el 30 de julio de 1941 en Ottawa en el seno de una familia de origen libanés.\n\nSu formación musical es breve: estudió piano con Winnifred Rees y teoría con Frederick Karam, cantando en el coro que este último dirigía en la iglesia siria ortodoxa de San Elías. \n\nAnimado por sus padres, grabó su primer single \"I Confess\" (Confieso) a la edad de 14 años. En 1957 marchó a Nueva York donde realizó pruebas para la ABC (American Broadcasting Company) con la canción \"Diana\"","tags":["jazz","swing","oldies","Canadian","easy listening"]},"works":[{"id":167764867783506,"type":"song","name":"Diana","artist":"Paul Anka","year":1957,"weight":20,"yt":"98Q0fuBwt-g","src":"books,charts,ensayos,singles","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[{"name":"A History of Rock Music in 500 Songs","n":2}],"lists":[{"id":231699243535749,"name":"Billboard Year-End 1957","rank":24,"scaruffi":null},{"id":280026104147222,"name":"UK Best Selling Singles","rank":null,"scaruffi":null},{"id":95472960493301,"name":"UK nº1 · 1950s","rank":63,"scaruffi":null},{"id":23636244894326,"name":"Spain Singles Chart","rank":1,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":5}},{"id":232632867811630,"type":"song","name":"Lonely Boy","artist":"Paul Anka","year":1959,"weight":13,"yt":"KKcCaCgMLBE","src":"charts,ensayos,singles","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[{"name":"Hit Parade Music History and Music Trivia","n":2}],"lists":[{"id":245563783135764,"name":"Billboard Year-End 1959","rank":5,"scaruffi":null},{"id":157497903047680,"name":"Billboard Hot 100 nº1 · 1960s","rank":16,"scaruffi":null},{"id":23636244894326,"name":"Spain Singles Chart","rank":1,"scaruffi":null},{"id":132335824845498,"name":"Bill